WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:02.940
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:09.080
Today I am going to explain a South Korean
comedy film called “Slow Video.”

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.820
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:16.340
Watch out and take care!

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:21.180
The movie starts in a CCTV control center
where two women are talking about their new

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.890
young coworker.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:26.890
He is wearing sunglasses indoors which the
women think is weird.

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:30.220
Suddenly, they detect two robbers on the run.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:33.539
Their boss is notified and they quickly call
the police.

00:00:33.539 --> 00:00:38.420
Everyone in the office tracks the robbers
through the cameras, and yet they get lost.

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:42.629
When they start losing hope, the new employee
shows them a clip of the robbers hiding in

00:00:42.629 --> 00:00:43.920
an alleyway.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:47.300
Because of his help, they are soon caught
by the police.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:52.019
The employee’s name is Yeo Jang-boo and
he has a rare genetic condition that makes

00:00:52.019 --> 00:00:54.480
him see everything in slow motion.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:58.710
Using his disorder, he was able to see where
the robbers went even though they were moving

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:00.170
at a high speed.

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:05.440
When Jang-boo was in class five, he took part
in a relay race with his childhood crush Bong

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.540
Soo-mi.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:09.850
That was when he first started to see things
in slow motion.

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:16.100
His parents took him to doctor Seok who diagnosed
him with dynamic visual acuity, a rare disorder

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:21.369
that enables him to visually perceive fine
detail in a moving object that ordinary people

00:01:21.369 --> 00:01:25.180
cannot as if he's seeing the world in slow
motion.

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:30.219
To prove that Jang-boo in fact has the disorder,
the doctor throws a baseball at him at high

00:01:30.219 --> 00:01:36.810
speed, which he catches with ease.

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:41.460
The doctor advises him to wear sunglasses
at all times for comfort.

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:46.299
After Jang-boo is diagnosed, his father flies
to a foreign country to earn money for his

00:01:46.299 --> 00:01:47.299
treatment.

00:01:47.299 --> 00:01:50.299
Jang-boo is left at home with his mother and
younger sister.

00:01:50.299 --> 00:01:54.909
He claims that the disorder has been a blessing
and a curse at the same time.

00:01:54.909 --> 00:01:59.859
Although he could watch the wind move women’s
skirts in slow motion, he was bullied in school

00:01:59.859 --> 00:02:01.499
for his sunglasses.

00:02:01.499 --> 00:02:05.479
His only friend then was Soo-mi who he started
to fall in love with.

00:02:05.479 --> 00:02:12.020
But as time passed, Soo-mi got severely bullied
for being his friend and so, she left him.

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:14.890
Following that, Jang-boo has never had a friend.

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:19.420
He wanted to lose his eyesight altogether
so he watched TV all the time.

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:26.140
His vision didn’t really get worse but he
developed an obsession with k-dramas.

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:30.180
He learned all the social skills from the
actors in the drama but never got out of the

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:31.849
house to practice them.

00:02:31.849 --> 00:02:37.379
His father refused to return to Korea even
during the holidays to save money.

00:02:37.379 --> 00:02:42.659
But it all went to waste when one day he died
because of an accident in the workplace.

00:02:42.659 --> 00:02:47.099
Following the death, the only man that Jang-boo
is close to is doctor Seok.

00:02:47.099 --> 00:02:52.150
He advises him to see the world outside of
his room and help his family with money.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:56.200
That is why Jang-boo starts to work in the
CCTV control center.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:03:00.400
In a monologue, he claims that he likes to
watch people on the screen because it reminds

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:06.069
him of dramas, the only difference is that
in this drama, everyone is the lead actor.

00:03:06.069 --> 00:03:10.819
His coworker, Byeong-soo talks to their boss
about Jang-boo’s behavior, claiming that

00:03:10.819 --> 00:03:14.140
he is very introverted and doesn’t talk
to anyone.

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:17.520
He promises to take care of the guy because
he is a true talent.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:21.300
Byeong-soo sits beside him at work and tries
talking to Jang-boo.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:26.850
However, a shy Jang-boo answers all of Byeong-soo’s
questions in his head and doesn’t speak

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:27.850
to him.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:31.950
While monitoring the cameras, he seems to
be counting how many steps people take to

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:33.390
reach a certain place.

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:40.900
Byeong-soo thinks it’s weird but doesn’t
ask any questions.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:45.129
In an attempt to socialize with him, Byeong-soo
asks him if he has a girlfriend.

00:03:45.129 --> 00:03:49.459
This reminds Jang-boo of Soo-mi, so he goes
to her house the very next day.

00:03:49.459 --> 00:03:53.920
Soo-mi has grown up into a beautiful woman
but with financial issues.

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:57.879
Her debt collector nags her to sell the house
to pay back her loans.

00:03:57.879 --> 00:04:01.620
Jang-boo watches her from afar but is too
scared to go talk to her.

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:07.840
That day onwards, he watches her through the
CCTV cameras every day and memorizes her daily

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:08.840
routine.

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:13.500
At night she drinks soda in front of a coffee
shop, so he, too, does the same.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:18.160
He sees her eyeing an abandoned sofa on the
way and drags it in front of the coffee shop

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:19.310
the next day.

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:22.910
Soo-mi notices the sofa but doesn’t think
much of it.

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:27.030
The following day, she is stuck at a bus stop
because of heavy rainfall.

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:31.180
Jang-boo sees this on the monitor and goes
to help her with Byeong-soo.

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:35.690
He puts the umbrella over her like in the
k-dramas but Soo-mi calls him a creep and

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:37.260
walks away.

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:42.479
Following that, the two go to doctor Seok
asking for ways Jang-boo could impress Soo-mi.

00:04:42.479 --> 00:04:44.880
He suggests Jang-boo give her flowers.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:48.680
Soo-mi is late for her musical drama audition
the next day.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:52.980
She calls the manager and starts singing in
the middle of the road as her audition.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:57.199
As she sings a beautiful song, the bystanders
watch her in awe.

00:04:57.199 --> 00:04:59.900
Jang-boo also arrives there with a bouquet
of flowers.

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:04.190
He hands her the flower after the song but
Soo-mi doesn’t appreciate it.

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:10.419
She tells him she would rather prefer a box
of ramen and walks away.

00:05:10.419 --> 00:05:15.320
Jang-boo calls her name and finally introduces
himself as her childhood best friend.

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:19.330
But she claims that her name is Oh Soo-mi
and not Bong Soo-mi.

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:24.400
It turns out Jang-boo has been following the
wrong woman all this time, yet he has started

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:26.310
to fall for her deeply.

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:30.590
That evening, they accidentally bump into
each other and Soo-mi makes Jang-boo carry

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:31.590
her groceries.

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:36.520
Before leaving, Soo-mi asks him why he is
looking for Bong Soo-mi to which he replies

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:38.740
that he used to like her in school.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:43.520
The next day at work, Jang-boo sees Soo-mi
receive a phone call on the monitor.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:47.490
The person on the other end informs her that
she got a role in the musical.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:52.240
She jumps and dances in the streets as Jang-boo
watches her on the screen.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:56.110
That night, Soo-mi goes to celebrate at a
local roadside restaurant.

00:05:56.110 --> 00:06:00.090
She notices Jang-boo watching her from outside
and invites him in.

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:04.419
As they talk, she shows him the musical’s
script and practices her lines.

00:06:04.419 --> 00:06:08.300
Jang-boo compliments her acting and shows
her a talent of his own.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:13.990
Soon, the entire restaurant watches Jang-boo
catch spoons thrown at him.

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:18.830
The following day, Jang-boo walks around Soo-mi’s
neighborhood while counting his steps.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:23.810
Byeong-soo sees him doing this and realizes
he is trying to memorize the ways.

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:27.750
While returning home, Soo-mi finds Jang-boo
waiting for her.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:30.669
They walk together talking about several things.

00:06:30.669 --> 00:06:35.580
She asks him what his job is and finds out
that he works at the CCTV center and can watch

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.210
people all day.

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:40.740
They stop in front of the cafe that Soo-mi
always stares at.

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:46.009
She reveals that she has a crush on the cafe’s
owner and gushes about him owning a car.

00:06:46.009 --> 00:06:50.340
A jealous Jang-boo stares at the owner for
a long time.

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:53.870
He has made up his mind to take her on a ride
to impress her.

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:57.870
He asks everyone at work if they own a car
in hopes of borrowing it.

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:00.450
However, none of them happen to own one.

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:03.690
While returning home, Soo-mi is approached
by the debt collector.

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:08.160
He starts to yell at her and threatens to
hit her if she doesn’t return the money.

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:13.020
Jang-boo and Byeong-soo arrive there right
on time and save her from the man.

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:17.690
When Jang-boo returns to work, Soo-mi yells
thank you to one of the cameras, knowing that

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:19.900
he is watching on the other end.

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:23.830
At the end of the day, they meet at a park
and talk for a long time.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:28.069
Jang-boo asks her what she would do if she
owned a car to which Soo-mi says that she

00:07:28.069 --> 00:07:30.620
would drive to the sea every day.

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:34.770
Since he cannot get a car, Jang-boo befriends
his local bus driver by traveling with him

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:35.770
all day.

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:39.879
He had been watching the driver play baseball
alone at night through the cameras.

00:07:39.879 --> 00:07:44.620
At the end of the day, Jang-boo joins him
for a game and asks him for a favor.

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:50.229
Byeong-soo, the bus driver, and Jang-boo pick
up Soo-mi from the bus stop the next day and

00:07:50.229 --> 00:07:53.120
make their way to Busan to visit the sea.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:58.830
Seeing his efforts to make her happy, Soo-mi
starts to like Jang-boo.

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:04.930
However, their bus is stopped by the border
police who don’t allow the local district

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:06.810
bus to enter the other district.

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:11.980
An angered Soo-mi tries to fight the policeman
while Byeong-soo calms her down.

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:16.289
Their effort is useless because at the end
of the day, they have to return home without

00:08:16.289 --> 00:08:17.780
reaching the sea.

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:22.400
Jang-boo’s boss tells them about recent
cases of women being abducted around the town

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:25.530
and asks them to be on high alert at all times.

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:31.620
Just then, Jang-boo notices Soo-mi on a monitor
but she disappears right after.

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:36.580
He freaks out and rushes to see if she is
okay only to see that she was trying to prank

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:38.710
him to see if he will come.

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:43.370
Soo-mi takes off his glasses for the first
time and the two finally kiss.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:45.780
Jang-boo takes Soo-mi home and she invites
him in.

00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:52.190
However, their plans are ruined when Soo-mi
notices the debt collectors in her house.

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:56.270
They throw her belongings around threatening
her to return the money.

00:08:56.270 --> 00:09:01.420
Jang-boo tries to run to her but suddenly
falls down as his vision goes blurry.

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:05.400
After the men leave, Jang-boo and Soo-mi sit
down to talk.

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:10.390
In the pile of stuff that the collectors threw
out are drawings that Jang-boo made for Soo-mi

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:11.840
when they were in school.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:16.370
Soo-mi reveals that she lied to him about
being a different girl because she didn’t

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:19.000
want to be compared to her younger self.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:26.100
Jang-boo keeps quiet the whole time as Soo-mi
looks at the drawings while smiling.

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:30.580
He visits doctor Seok the next day, informing
him that his eyes have gotten blurry.

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:34.940
It turns out that with time, his disorder
has gotten worse, because of which he will

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:37.920
be losing his vision very soon.

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:41.620
Jang-boo had known that he would eventually
go blind one day, that is why he has been

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:46.410
counting steps everywhere he goes, so it would
be easier for him when he loses his vision

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:47.630
entirely.

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:52.490
While Jang-boo is troubled by his worsening
vision, Soo-mi is worried about her debt.

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:57.160
She sells her house and gathers enough money
to pay her creditors back but now, she has

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:58.760
nowhere to live.

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:03.840
Jang-boo watches her on screen while she talks
to a shopkeeper with a box of her belongings.

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:09.100
Suddenly, his coworker notices a car suspiciously
circling the same area.

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:13.730
She looks closely at its number plate and
notices that the car belongs to a kidnapper

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:14.920
on the run.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:18.090
She notifies the boss and the police are informed
immediately.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:24.620
However, they lose sight of the car and at
the same time, Jang-boo loses sight of Soo-mi.

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:28.040
He freaks out and runs to save her from potential
danger.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:32.170
On his way, he loses his vision completely
and crashes the bike.

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:35.690
Byeong-soo notices this through the cameras
and runs to help him.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:40.260
Soo-mi, on the other hand, is approached by
a strange man who grabs her arm.

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:44.610
But before he can take her away, Jang-boo
starts to run towards them.

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:48.570
The abductor runs away but Jang-boo almost
crashes into a bus.

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:52.320
The police arrive and take Soo-mi in for interrogation.

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:56.890
Now, Jang-boo is left alone in the streets
and is helped by Byeong-soo.

00:10:56.890 --> 00:11:01.490
He cries while holding his friend, devastated
on losing his vision.

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:03.370
Several days have passed since the incident.

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:07.310
Soo-mi gets busy with her life and doesn’t
contact Jang-boo.

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.770
She looks at the CCTV cameras often when she
misses him.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:14.680
A few months later, she notices Jang-boo inside
her favorite cafe.

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:19.470
She happily approaches him and waves her hand
but is shocked when Jang-boo brings out his

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:21.720
stick and walks the other way.

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:25.830
She follows him around the town and finally
reaches an art gallery that is filled with

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:28.630
paintings of her that Jang-boo has drawn.

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:33.920
In a monologue, Jang-boo says that he has
lost his vision but he still remembers her.

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:38.540
The next day, Soo-mi again follows him but
this time, he asks her where she wants to

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:39.540
go.

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:44.350
She realizes that he can sense her and the
movie ends as the two hug.

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:48.460
